<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>合格証明書</title>
  <style>
    body {
      background: #f5f5f5;
      font-family: "Hiragino Mincho ProN", "Yu Mincho", "Noto Serif JP", serif;
      margin: 0;
    }

    /* ===== 追加ヘッダー用 ===== */
    .header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 12px 20px;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
    }

    .back-btn {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #333;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .app-title {
      font-size: 18px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      position: absolute;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
    }

    /* ===== 証明書デザイン ===== */
    .certificate-wrapper {
      width: 794px;
      height: 1123px;
      margin: 30px auto;
      background: #fff;
      padding: 30px;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    .certificate {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      border: 6px double #c9a24d;
      padding: 40px 50px;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      position: relative;
    }

    .cert-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .logo {
      width: 80px;
      height: 80px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f5b041, #d68910);
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: #fff;
      font-weight: bold;
      font-size: 32px;
    }

    .header-text {
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: bold;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    .sub-title {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 20px;
      margin: 20px 0 10px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .main-title {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 48px;
      letter-spacing: 12px;
      margin: 20px 0 40px;
    }

    .name {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 28px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .info {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 2;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .message {
      width: 80%;
      margin: 0 auto 60px;
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 2;
    }

    .footer {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 40px;
      left: 50px;
      right: 50px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-end;
    }

    .org {
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .sign-area {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .sign-text {
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .seal {
      width: 80px;
      height: 80px;
      border: 2px solid #c0392b;
      color: #c0392b;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      text-align: center;
    }
    
    .otanjobi{
      color:red;
    }
    
    .back-btn {
      font-family: sans-serif;
    }

  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- ===== ここが追加部分 ===== -->
    <%= link_to "戻る", carender_path, class: "back-btn" %>
  <!-- ========================= -->

  <div class="certificate-wrapper">
    <div class="certificate">
      <div class="cert-header">
        <div class="logo">PM</div>
        <div class="header-text">Proof Meよりお母様へ勉強したことの証明</div>
      </div>

      <div class="sub-title">
        本日のお勉強時間
      </div>
      

      <div class="main-title">お勉強証明書</div>

      <div class="name"><%= current_user.user_id %> 殿</div>

      <div class="info">
        認定年月日：<%= @date.strftime("%Y年%m月%d日") %>
      </div>

      <div class="message">
        上記の者は、本日以下の時間勉強に励みました。<br />
        我々PM運営委員会一同が、<br />
        お子様が勉強をしたことを証明させて頂きます。
      </div>
      
      <% subjects = {
        "国語" => @jap,
        "数学" => @mat,
        "理科" => @sci,
        "社会" => @soc,
        "英語" => @eng,
        "その他" => @els
      } %>

      <div class = "info">
        <% if @study_records.any? %>
            <% @study_records.each do |record| %>
              <div>
                <%= record.subject %>
                <%= record.content %>
                （<%= record.duration_seconds / 60 %>分<%= record.duration_seconds % 60 %>秒）
              </div>
            <% end %>
          <% else %>
            <h1>おっと、今日は<span class = "otanjobi">お誕生日</span>かな？？</h1>
          <% end %>
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        <div class="org">
          発行年月日　<%= @date.strftime("%Y年%m月%d日") %><br />
          一般社団法人 PM運営青少年対母親保護委員会<br />
          Proof Me to mom
        </div>

        <div class="sign-area">
          <div class="sign-text">代表理事 ｱﾝﾋﾞｼｬｽ 佐藤</div>
          <div class="seal">
            委員会<br />認定印
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
